IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-companies-domain`

§ `Part 10 — Dissolution`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Companies Act 1967 (Singapore), Part 10, ss 247–344H.
-- Source: SSO current version as at 07 Sep 2026.
--
-- Divisions 1–3 and most of Division 4: Repealed by Act 40 of 2018
-- (moved to Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018).
--
-- Only ss 344–344H survive: striking off, restoration, and book
-- retention for defunct companies.
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `Striking off — s 344`


§§§ `s 344 — Registrar-initiated strike-off`

-- s 344(1): 30-day response period
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 344(1)"
`strike off response days` MEANS 30

-- s 344(2): 60-day Gazette notice period before strike-off
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 344(2)"
`strike off gazette notice days` MEANS 60

-- s 344(3)(b): liquidator default period triggering strike-off
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 344(3)(b)"
`liquidator default months before strike off` MEANS 6

-- s 344(5): 6-year window to apply for court restoration
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 344(5)"
`court restoration application years` MEANS 6


§§§ `s 344A — Company-initiated strike-off`

-- s 344A(3): 30-day response period
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 344A(3)"
`voluntary strike off response days` MEANS 30

-- s 344A(4): 60-day Gazette notice period
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 344A(4)"
`voluntary strike off gazette notice days` MEANS 60


§§ `Restoration — ss 344D–344G`


§§§ `s 344D — Administrative restoration`

-- s 344D(4): 6-year deadline for application
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 344D(4)"
`administrative restoration application years` MEANS 6


§§§ `s 344G — Effect of restoration`

-- s 344G(4): 3-year window for court directions after restoration
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 344G(4)"
`post restoration court direction years` MEANS 3


§§ `Book retention — s 344H`


§§§ `s 344H — Retention of books after dissolution`

-- s 344H(1): 5-year retention period
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 344H(1)"
`dissolved company book retention years` MEANS 5

-- s 344H(2): penalty for non-compliance
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 344H(2)"
`penalty for book retention failure` MEANS 2000


