§§ `Part 10 — Illustrations`

-- Constant assertions (verify threshold values are correctly encoded)
#ASSERT `strike off response days` EQUALS 30
#ASSERT `strike off gazette notice days` EQUALS 60
#ASSERT `court restoration application years` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `administrative restoration application years` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `post restoration court direction years` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `dissolved company book retention years` EQUALS 5
